<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuadorian fishermen have filed a lawsuit against the Trump administration, alleging that a drone attack sank their boat near the Galápagos and caused injuries. A man was sentenced to 57 months in prison for a controlled substance offense linked to prison gang drug trafficking. Violence against civilians continues, with a journalist murdered outside his home, two local election candidates shot dead in El Oro, and a priest killed when a crucifix fell during mass. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNZ3g4ODh6X3JMRUl6OE9MNzNFclBLM09acm5ZbmJsdDRlMmRMS0RzVDJBRFhxT3ZhR09TcEJ5WmVKTWdqM3F1bko4UnloVHpIR09Ja2NyX1h3TWM2emZtSDlUWEE1UnNaR01ZT0FaZ05hcHpiQ0hpUk5VWWtKVVlzYjNmY0tVamJld3QzUjNHQTA0ZDg5MXd3VFJKN0szNUpKaU9JRlVZY1NPcnRUdXZUeE1GbVN3THZOV0cyMVg0VQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNcW5rUERZbGVnSVIzRE5mN2hsLUd4THFITGNBdXZ3SmJwTE8zTXRIOE9zZ3NSdDl2RWVMem9qMFByYTZKZ05JYWRIQjhfOXJFb0xFYUJqdXZfblZUcnpOd051X1MxUUdRS0tDeXIwckQ2OHk3QUlMcUcxaWlvMFBfaE43U20?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNZDV0RWU2WF9iWnFfOE1Uc1MyTWFhVlM1WjJrVFR0YnhRdU1zXzM2LWQ2OE1SeFY1UXAwQzh4WERhWUgxRlFfSlhnVGo0enVsVWdpbWlvTzBhZUFEbjNYNTNYYWNlaWRTbHplaVhUY0JBR25takxLUTdJUTN6YUotblhidEZtVlZFMUoySE9YTlJ0MlQ1cEtPODVFLU0zNGxSbFl4ZlhTNUdzZUFHMllGbDlDMUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Documented&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Fox News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Herald Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;CoastTV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KTVN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss